<title>PHILIPPINES: Saniwares Q3 net loss at 7.415 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Saniwares Q3 net loss at 7.415 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bathroom fixtures maker Sanitary Wares Manufacturing Corp posted a net loss of 7.415 million pesos in the third quarter this year, documents submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Friday said.</p>
<p>Sales reached 151.358 million pesos, while cost of goods sold was at 121.044 million pesos.</p>
<p>Operating expenses amounted to 32.848 million pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
